
    <p>Dear {{ $preferred_name }},</p>
    <p>Thank you so much for being patient. We are working hard to process all of the therapy requests received and to continue raising funding to cover the costs of therapy for persons within our community.</p>
    <p>You are important to us and we want you to know that you will be connected to a mental health practitioner as soon as we have space available. Should your circumstances have changed or your level of need increased, please do get in touch.</p>
    <p>One of our therapists or counsellors will be in contact, as soon as we have availability, to arrange an assessment session.</p>
    <p>To provide consistency and support we have an ongoing variety of <a href="https://pineapplesupport.org/support-groups/"> support groups</a> that are therapist-led, as well as peer support options. We highly encourage usage of these incredibly helpful resources at this time.</p>
    <p>With love, the Pineapple Support therapy team</p>

